SUMMARY:Fear Forest of Navarre haunted trail
DESCRIPTION:Fear Forest is a charity haunted trail behind the Community of
  Christ in Navarre\, where each food item or donation buys one pass throu
 gh the woods. Food goes to Feeding the Gulf Coast and cash to the church.
  There is also a kid carnival described as more fun than frightening\, a 
 Nerf zombie hunt and a concession stand. The line is cut off at 10 PM\, a
 nd the chamber says to come early because it gets crowded.\nPrice: Free\n
 Area: Gulf Breeze & Navarre\nTimes: Friday 10/23 and Saturday 10/24 · 6:
 00 PM to 10:00 PM\, line closes at 10:00 PM\nChecked against the venue's 
 own page on 2026-10-23\nhttps://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-fear-fores
 t-navarre-1023.html
